+---
+id: task-41
+title: >-
+  Phase 2.2: Add background job processing for heavy dashboard calculations
+  (weekly growth, performance metrics aggregation)
+status: Done
+assignee: [@ampcode-com]
+created_date: '2025-10-31 13:56'
+updated_date: '2025-11-02 03:00'
+labels: []
+dependencies: []
