+# Task: Update UI Components Architecture in Scientific Branch
+
+## Task ID: task-update-ui-components-architecture
+
+## Priority: Medium
+
+## Status: Todo
+
+## Description
+Update the UI components architecture in the scientific branch to align with the more recent interface implementations in the main branch. This includes React frontend, Gradio UI, and dashboard components.
+
+## Target Branch
+- Branch: `scientific`
+- Based on: Current scientific branch state
+- Integration target: Main branch UI architecture
+
+## Specific Changes to Include
+1. Update React frontend components to match main branch
+2. Align Gradio UI implementation with main branch
+3. Update dashboard components to match main branch
+4. Ensure consistent API integration patterns
+
+## Action Plan
+
+### Part 1: UI Architecture Assessment
+1. Compare UI implementations between branches
+2. Identify differences in component architecture
+3. Document improvements in main branch UI
+4. Assess current UI functionality in scientific branch
+
+### Part 2: Implementation
+1. Update React components to match main branch patterns
+2. Align Gradio UI with main branch implementation
+3. Update dashboard components for consistency
+4. Ensure API integration patterns are aligned
+
+### Part 3: Testing
+1. Run UI-specific tests for all components
+2. Verify React frontend functionality
+3. Test Gradio UI components work correctly
+4. Validate dashboard displays data as expected
+
+### Part 4: Validation
+1. Perform UI functionality checks
+2. Run full test suite to catch regressions
+3. Validate user experience consistency
+4. Document changes for UI developers
+
+## Success Criteria
+- [ ] React frontend components aligned with main branch
+- [ ] Gradio UI implementation updated and functional
+- [ ] Dashboard components consistent with main branch
+- [ ] UI tests pass
+- [ ] User experience is consistent and functional
+- [ ] API integration works as expected
+- [ ] PR created and ready for review
+
+## Dependencies
+- AI/NLP architecture update completed
+- UI component documentation from main branch available
+
+## Estimated Effort
+2-3 days: Assessment and implementation
+1 day: UI testing
+0.5 days: Validation and documentation
+0.5 days: PR creation
+
+## Notes
+- UI changes can have wide impact, thorough testing is essential
+- Ensure responsive design is maintained
+- Validate accessibility standards are met
+- Consider user experience during transition
