+```
+
+**Diagnosis:**
+```bash
+# Check cache file integrity
+ls -la email_cache.db
+file email_cache.db
+```
+
+**Solutions:**
+```python
+# Clear corrupted cache
+collector = GmailDataCollector()
+await collector.clear_cache()
+
+# Reinitialize cache
+await collector.initialize_cache()
+```
