+### Data Flow
+```
+Notmuch Database → NotmuchDataSource → Search Queries → UI Display
+      ↓                    ↓                        ↓
+   Email Indexing    Data Abstraction         User Interaction
+   (Xapian)         (DataSource Interface)   (Gradio Components)
