+```
+
+**Diagnosis:**
+```bash
+# Check database statistics
+notmuch count
+
+# Analyze query performance
+time notmuch search "tag:inbox"
+
+# Check disk I/O
+iotop -o
+```
+
+**Solutions:**
+```bash
